<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy | Oryele" description="Learn how Oryele uses cookies and similar technologies."><section class="legal"><div class="wrap"><h1>Cookie Policy</h1><p>Oryele may use essential cookies required for site operation, security, preferences, and basic analytics. We do not use cookies to sell personal information.</p><h2>Essential cookies</h2><p>These support security, navigation, authentication, and core website functions.</p><h2>Analytics and preferences</h2><p>Where enabled, these help us understand site performance and remember user preferences.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You may control cookies through your browser settings. Disabling essential cookies may affect website functionality.</p><p>Questions may be sent to <a href="mailto:privacy@oryele.com">privacy@oryele.com</a>.</p></div></section></BaseLayout><style>.legal{padding-block:90px}.legal .wrap{max-width:880px}.legal h1{font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,68px)}.legal h2{margin-top:34px}.legal p{font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;color:#3f4d64}</style>
